{"base_rate":0.055284552845528454,"brier":0.03604032520325203,"bss":0.3099447200566974,"bss_hi":0.48528437006139896,"bss_lo":0.07279430405052412,"chart":{"base":[133.7,149.4],"fp":[172.2,215.2],"lead":"62,269.8 272,245.9 482,226.3 692,185","note":{"base":"skill 0.31 — higher than 50% of cities","fp":"low end -1pp, high end +22pp","lead":"day-1 error 0.9 °C — better than 82% of cities","rel":"promised 0% → rained 0%; promised 27% → rained 22%"},"rel":"64.2,465.1 231.2,371"},"country":"IR","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.016097560975609757,"ess":343.03775969665674,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Isfahan</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Isfahan rain forecast is moderately skilful, and honest except at one point on the scale.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (50%), believe about\n<b>41%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>0%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 615 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-02-26. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 20.6 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.31, ranked 67 of\n134 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(20&ndash;123) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>0%</b></td><td class='num'>411</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>3%</td><td class='num'><b>0%</b></td><td class='num'>54</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>10%</td><td class='num'><b>8%</b></td><td class='num'>86</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>50%</td><td class='num'><b>41%</b></td><td class='num'>64</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">1 of 4 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Isfahan</b> <span class=\"muted\">IR</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag ok\">Moderately skilful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">honest except at one point</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.31</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>20&ndash;123\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 134</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>615 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Isfahan &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Isfahan\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anch